  "description": "Songdeohill Town, a fortress for the top 1% of South Korea. It boasts comfortable privacy in the wealthiest neighborhood, a 24-hour concierge system, and various luxurious amenities. Within this seemingly perfect Songdeohill Town lives Yoo Heena, a caged bird.\n\n**Original Webtoon:**   \n[Naver Webtoon](https://comic.naver.com/webtoon/list?titleId=849061), [Naver Series](https://series.naver.com/comic/detail.series?productNo=13905880)\n\n**Official Translations:**    \n[Japanese](https://ebookjapan.yahoo.co.jp/stories/all/158761/), [French](https://www.webtoons.com/fr/romance/late-bloomer/list?title_no=10275), [T.Chinese](https://www.webtoons.com/zh-hant/romance-m/a-late-affair/list?title_no=10140), [Thai](https://www.webtoons.com/th/romance/late-starter/list?title_no=10509)",
